#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:2
msgid "Pull request previews"
msgstr "Pull Request 预览"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:4
msgid ""
"Read the Docs builds your documentation for every new pull request. "
"Previewing changes during review makes it easier to catch formatting and "
"display issues before they go live."
msgstr "Read the Docs 会为每个新的 Pull Request 构建文档。在审查期间预览变更，能更容易地在上线前发现格式和显示问题。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:7
msgid ""
"Pull request previews are enabled by default on new projects. You can "
"configure them from your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Pull request"
" builds`."
msgstr ""
"新项目默认启用 Pull Request 预览。你可以在项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Pull request "
"builds` 中配置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:11
msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:13
msgid "Build on pull request events"
msgstr "在 Pull Request 事件上构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:14
msgid ""
"We create and build a new version when a pull request is opened, and rebuild"
" it whenever a new commit is pushed."
msgstr "Pull Request 打开时我们会创建并构建一个新版本，每当有新提交推送时就会重新构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:17
msgid "Build status report"
msgstr "构建状态报告"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:18
msgid ""
"Your project's pull request build status will show as one of your pull "
"request's checks. This status will update as the build is running, and will "
"show a success or failure status when the build completes."
msgstr "项目的 Pull Request 构建状态将显示为 Pull Request 的检查项之一。该状态会在构建运行时更新，构建完成时显示成功或失败状态。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:22
msgid "GitHub build status reporting for pull requests."
msgstr "GitHub Pull Request 的构建状态报告。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:27
msgid "GitHub build status reporting"
msgstr "GitHub 构建状态报告"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:29
msgid "Build overview with changed files"
msgstr "包含变更文件的构建概览"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:30
msgid ""
"We create a comment on the pull request including a link to the preview of "
"the documentation, and a list of the :doc:`files that changed </visual-"
"diff>` between the current pull request and the latest version of the "
"project's documentation."
msgstr ""
"我们会在 Pull Request 上创建一条评论，包含文档预览的链接，以及当前 Pull Request 与项目文档最新版本之间 "
":doc:`变更的文件列表 </visual-diff>`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:35
msgid ""
"This feature is only available for projects connected to a :ref:`reference"
"/git-integration:GitHub App`."
msgstr "此功能仅对连接了 :ref:`reference/git-integration:GitHub App` 的项目可用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:37
msgid "Pull request notifications"
msgstr "Pull Request 通知"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:38
msgid ""
"A pull request notification can be shown at the top of preview pages, which "
"lets readers know they aren't viewing an active version of the project. New "
"projects have this notification disabled by default; enable it from your "
"project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> Notifications`."
msgstr ""
"Pull Request 通知可显示在预览页面顶部，提醒读者他们查看的不是项目的活跃版本。新项目默认禁用此通知；可在项目的 "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> Notifications` 中启用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:43
msgid ":doc:`Visual diff </visual-diff>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Visual diff </visual-diff>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:44
msgid ""
"Visual diff shows proposed changes by visually highlighting the differences "
"between the current pull request and the latest version of the project's "
"documentation."
msgstr "Visual diff 通过可视化高亮显示当前 Pull Request 与项目文档最新版本之间的差异，展示拟议的变更。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:46
msgid "Press ``d`` to toggle between Visual diff and normal pull request preview."
msgstr "按 ``d`` 在 Visual diff 和普通 Pull Request 预览之间切换。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:50
msgid ":doc:`/guides/pull-requests`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/pull-requests`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:51
msgid "A guide to configuring pull request builds on Read the Docs."
msgstr "在 Read the Docs 上配置 Pull Request 构建的指南。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:54
msgid "Security"
msgstr "安全"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:56
msgid ""
"If pull request previews are enabled for your project, anyone who can open a"
" pull request on your repository will be able to trigger a build of your "
"documentation. For this reason, pull request previews are served from a "
"different domain than your main documentation (``org.readthedocs.build`` and"
" ``com.readthedocs.build``)."
msgstr ""
"如果项目启用了 Pull Request 预览，任何能在你的仓库打开 Pull Request 的人都能触发文档构建。因此，Pull Request "
"预览使用与主文档不同的域名（``org.readthedocs.build`` 和 ``com.readthedocs.build``）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:61
msgid ""
"Builds from pull requests have access to environment variables that are "
"marked as *Public* only. If you have environment variables with private "
"information, make sure they aren't marked as *Public*. See :ref"
":`environment-variables:Environment variables and build process` for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Pull Request 构建仅能访问标记为*公开* 的环境变量。如果你有包含私密信息的环境变量，请确保它们未标记为* 公开*。详情请参阅 :ref"
":`environment-variables:Environment variables and build process`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:65
msgid ""
"On |com_brand| you can set pull request previews to be private or public. If"
" you didn't import your project manually and your repository is public, the "
"privacy level of pull request previews will be set to *Public*. Public pull "
"request previews are available to anyone with the link to the preview, while"
" private previews are only available to users with access to the Read the "
"Docs project."
msgstr ""
"在 |com_brand| 上，你可以将 Pull Request 预览设为私有或公开。如果你不是手动导入项目且仓库是公开的，Pull Request "
"预览的隐私级别将设为*公开*。公开预览对任何有链接的人可见，私有预览仅对有 Read the Docs 项目访问权限的用户可见。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:73
msgid ""
"If you set the privacy level of pull request previews to *Private*, make "
"sure that only trusted users can open pull requests in your repository."
msgstr "如果将 Pull Request 预览的隐私级别设为*私有*，请确保只有受信任的用户能在你的仓库打开 Pull Request。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/pull-requests.rst:76
msgid ""
"Setting pull request previews to private on a public repository can allow a "
"malicious user to access read-only APIs using the user's session that is "
"reading the pull request preview. Similar to `GHSA-pw32-ffxw-68rh "
"<https://github.com/readthedocs/readthedocs.org/security/advisories/GHSA-"
"pw32-ffxw-68rh>`__."
msgstr ""
"在公开仓库上将 Pull Request 预览设为私有，可能允许恶意用户利用正在阅读 Pull Request 预览的用户会话访问只读 API。类似 "
"`GHSA-pw32-ffxw-68rh "
"<https://github.com/readthedocs/readthedocs.org/security/advisories/GHSA-"
"pw32-ffxw-68rh>`__。"

